Description: low-latency GNOME streaming for Rockchip
 rkwebscr creates a headless Ubuntu GNOME Wayland display and streams it to a web
 browser over WebRTC. It advertises rkwebscr.local with mDNS. Video capture
 uses DMA-BUF and Rockchip MPP H.264 hardware encoding; audio is encoded as Opus.
